{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Since the terms in the expression *do not* share a common monomial factor and the coefficient on the leading $x^2$ term *is not* $1$, let's *factor by grouping*. \n\nThe expression $\\purple{8}x^2\\green{-18}x\\blue{-5}$  is in the form $\\purple{A}x^2+\\green{B}x+\\blue{C}$. First, we need to find two integers $\\pink{a}$ and $\\pink{b}$ such that:\n\n$\\begin{cases}\n\u0026\\pink{a}+\\pink{b}=\\green{B}=\\green{-18}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\pink{ab}=\\purple{A}\\blue{C}= (\\purple{8})(\\blue{-5})=-40\n\\end{cases}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"We find that $\\pink{a}=\\pink{2}$ and $\\pink{b}=\\pink{-20}$ satisfy these conditions, since $\\pink{2}+(\\pink{-20})=\\green{-18}$ and $(\\pink{2})(\\pink{-20})=-40$.\n\nNext, we can use these values to rewrite the $x$-term and factor by grouping.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n8x^2-18x-5\u0026=8x^2+\\pink{2}x\\pink{-20}x-5\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2x(4x+1)-5(4x+1)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(4x+1)(2x-5)\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$8x^2-18x-5=(4x+1)(2x-5)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor the quadratic expression completely.**\n\n$8x^2-18x-5=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":0,"value":"(2x-5)(4x+1)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":1,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":2,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x-2.5\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":3,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\left(x+0.25\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":4,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x-2.5\\right)\\left(x+0.25\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":5,"simplify":false,"value":"(4x+1)(2x-5)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":6,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":7,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\left(x-2.5\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":8,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x+0.25\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)"},{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":9,"simplify":false,"value":"8\\left(x+0.25\\right)\\left(x-2.5\\right)"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
